WEBVTT

00:20.840 --> 00:23.640
We live in a world
where we strive for equality,

00:25.880 --> 00:29.480
but many people
don't take equal responsibility

00:29.560 --> 00:31.800
for the mistake they made together.

00:36.680 --> 00:40.320
Some choose to bear the consequences
of their actions,

00:44.000 --> 00:47.960
while some choose
to pretend to be blind to it.

00:49.240 --> 00:52.560
Because it's the option
that lets them off easy.

01:03.520 --> 01:05.680
They think they can forget
about the burden…

01:07.440 --> 01:09.680
