02:40.840 --> 02:41.720
Hello.

02:41.800 --> 02:45.080
I'm Nanno. It's nice to meet you all.

02:45.760 --> 02:47.360
Hmm.

02:47.440 --> 02:49.160
Nanno, you can sit over…

02:52.000 --> 02:54.640
