-Some best friend.

02:57.080 --> 02:58.920
You just screw me over for a girl.

02:59.000 --> 03:00.160
Oh.

03:00.240 --> 03:02.960
-You can sit at that desk over there.
-Thank you.

03:04.640 --> 03:06.320
See? Are you happy now?

03:06.400 --> 03:09.240
You ended up kicking me out of my seat
for nothing, you asshole.

03:09.760 --> 03:11.960
You still don't get it.

03:12.040 --> 03:13.640
If you can make her laugh…

03:14.360 --> 03:17.000
