-Hmm.

03:23.120 --> 03:25.360
Hello, Nanno. I'm Lookmhee.

03:25.440 --> 03:27.280
Clouds are made of water vapor.

03:27.360 --> 03:28.600
The droplets of…

03:29.720 --> 03:31.360
Oh, his name is Nanai.

03:31.440 --> 03:34.040
