to be the next student president.

03:34.120 --> 03:35.320
Mm…

03:35.400 --> 03:36.920
Nanno, don't fall for him.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.840
Nanai's knocked up half the girls here.

03:38.920 --> 03:41.400
