wanna eat with you either.

04:33.800 --> 04:34.920
Yeah.

04:35.000 --> 04:36.480
Well, Pim, you're right.

04:37.440 --> 04:40.000
If I could have Nanno
spoon-feed me like that,

04:40.080 --> 04:42.800
