30:14.280 --> 30:15.320
What did you do?

30:16.880 --> 30:19.760
What kind of man goes
and gets himself pregnant?

30:19.840 --> 30:20.920
Come out and answer me.

30:24.200 --> 30:26.080
If you're not gonna help,
then just shut up.

30:26.160 --> 30:28.440
Do you have any idea
how many times I needed to…

30:28.960 --> 30:30.400
dig you out of a mess?

30:32.000 --> 30:34.160
-You're nothing but trouble.
-That's enough.

30:36.040 --> 30:37.680
I don't care what disease you have,

30:38.720 --> 30:41.800
just take my money
and take care of it right now.

30:42.320 --> 30:45.040
If you can't, don't bother coming back!

30:46.840 --> 30:49.040
So typical, huh?

30:49.120 --> 30:50.920
-You only care about yourself!
-Punk.

30:51.000 --> 30:52.040
Huh? Huh?

30:52.120 --> 30:54.880
You forced your secretary
to get an abortion!

30:54.960 --> 30:56.400
Did I say anything then?

32:01.480 --> 32:02.720
Fuck!

32:18.720 --> 32:20.200
Oh.

33:35.440 --> 33:37.120
Fuck! It hurts!

35:25.280 --> 35:29.480
DO YOU KNOW HOW YOU GOT PREGNANT?

35:30.440 --> 35:34.840
WHO WAS THE LAST PERSON YOU BANGED
BEFORE YOU GOT PREGNANT?

35:53.680 --> 35:54.520
Hey.

35:56.000 --> 35:59.840
Nanai, I almost didn't recognize you
with your new look.

36:01.400 --> 36:02.640
What did you do to me?

36:03.120 --> 36:04.040
Do what?

36:05.080 --> 36:06.960
We were just fooling around.

36:07.520 --> 36:10.720
It was a casual hookup that…
we both enjoyed.

36:10.800 --> 36:12.320
Didn't we both enjoy it?

36:15.440 --> 36:18.200
-Mm-hmm.
-Nanno. Nanno!

36:35.560 --> 36:36.680
Petch.

36:41.400 --> 36:42.240
Petch.

36:46.760 --> 36:47.840
Nanai?

37:01.080 --> 37:02.000
Petch.

37:05.200 --> 37:07.440
I'm sorry.

37:09.480 --> 37:11.400
I'm sorry for everything.

37:13.040 --> 37:15.040
I understand how you feel now.

37:18.040 --> 37:19.960
I'm sorry I made you look bad.

37:21.520 --> 37:24.280
I'm sorry I left you
to go through this alone.

37:27.600 --> 37:29.960
I'm sorry I put you in this situation.

37:36.480 --> 37:38.360
It happened a long time ago, Nanai.

37:43.320 --> 37:44.920
I'm not mad at you anymore.

37:48.080 --> 37:49.920
You don't have to apologize.

37:55.840 --> 37:59.040
I guess we were both to blame
for what happened back then.

38:07.240 --> 38:08.440
Besides…

38:10.880 --> 38:12.840
I'm happy with the decision I made.

38:14.120 --> 38:14.960
It's fine.

38:47.080 --> 38:48.560
Good luck, Nanai.

39:56.360 --> 39:57.640
This will hurt a little.

39:58.160 --> 39:59.000
Hold still.

40:01.640 --> 40:04.120
It will be over soon.

40:05.440 --> 40:06.480
Okay.

40:29.480 --> 40:31.560
Hmm.

40:31.640 --> 40:32.680
Don't worry.

40:34.400 --> 40:36.640
You'll wake up in no time.

41:03.360 --> 41:05.520
Ooh. What the hell is that?

41:07.360 --> 41:08.360
It's your baby.

41:11.200 --> 41:12.360
-What?
-Mm.

41:12.920 --> 41:13.840
Hey. Hey, hey.

41:13.920 --> 41:16.000
-But I paid you to get rid of the baby.
-Hmm.

41:16.080 --> 41:19.400
I was only a few months pregnant.
I don't understand.

41:19.920 --> 41:23.120
As you can see,
you carried it for the full term.

41:23.200 --> 41:25.840
This here is a healthy baby
and it's yours to take care of.

41:25.920 --> 41:27.120
But…

41:29.800 --> 41:31.240
but I paid you…

41:33.880 --> 41:35.640
to get rid of this baby.

41:38.360 --> 41:39.880
If you really want her killed…

41:41.960 --> 41:43.280
you can do it yourself.

44:01.640 --> 44:03.240
I'm sorry.

44:22.480 --> 44:23.320
Nanno.

44:31.920 --> 44:33.200
What a cute baby.

44:36.280 --> 44:37.280
Nanno.

44:38.280 --> 44:39.640
I'm sorry for what I did.

44:41.080 --> 44:42.640
Please, I can be a better man.

44:44.360 --> 44:45.200
Nanno…

44:46.640 --> 44:47.960
will you come back to me?

44:53.280 --> 44:56.240
No, thanks. I'm only here to visit you.

44:59.320 --> 45:00.960
I brought you a gift.

45:04.480 --> 45:05.320
Why?

45:06.160 --> 45:08.080
But, why did you come here?

45:09.040 --> 45:10.840
To see if you're a good father.

45:11.400 --> 45:13.880
Or I should say a good mother?

45:14.360 --> 45:15.960
You've put my mind at ease.

45:16.960 --> 45:18.200
Nanno.

45:18.280 --> 45:20.600
Nanno. Nanno. Don't go, Nanno.

45:20.680 --> 45:22.800
Nanno, Nanno, Nanno, stay with me.

45:43.400 --> 45:44.880
LOL
